[I] Modern diagram scripting language that turns text to diagrams

[T] D2 is a modern diagram scripting language that turns text to diagrams.
[T] Create beautiful diagrams in minutes. Simple syntax. Endlessly
[T] customizable. D2 is the fastest and easiest way to get a mental model from
[T] your head onto the screen, then make edits with your team.

[U] https://d2lang.com/

[A] Terrastruct Inc.
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/development
[F] CROSS

[L] MPL
[V] 0.9.0

[D] 74a1c778728685e00525889635f626b1aa25a3218d9c52ceb7ce1150 d2-0.9.0.tar.gz https://github.com/terrastruct/d2/archive/v0.9.0/

